{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Game</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your base to develop your economy.  Once you're ready, you can start attacking the enemy. Try to overcome their defenses and destroy their base. Depending on the game mode you choose, you either have to destroy all of the enemy's towers or their base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Timer</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is split into two phases: the planning phase and the action phase. During the planning phase, players can place, upgrade and configure towers. During the action phase, the towers perform their actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/extras/6ee3731ed23741953d6e65d20ec6c0ad.poster.avif?t=1757695233\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/extras/6ee3731ed23741953d6e65d20ec6c0ad.webm?t=1757695233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/extras/6ee3731ed23741953d6e65d20ec6c0ad.mp4?t=1757695233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Multiplayer</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has been tested with up to eight players at a time. In theory, it is possible to play with up to 100 players in the same lobby. The server capacities are very easily scalable based on demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Campaign</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The campaign consists of multiple short, puzzle-like levels in which you must defeat your enemies. Your enemies won't build or upgrade towers, but you will need to try to become strong enough to reach their base before they reach yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Level Editor</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor allows you to create your own maps. These can be campaign levels or multiplayer maps. You can control the size of the map and which towers and neutral structures, such as gorges and rocks, have been built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also copy your map files and send them to friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2889420?t=1757695233","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757695233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/a6e785572fe2a3d736941ce1cf97a395c5d684e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757695233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/a6e785572fe2a3d736941ce1cf97a395c5d684e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757695233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Game</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your base to develop your economy.  Once you're ready, you can start attacking the enemy. Try to overcome their defenses and destroy their base. Depending on the game mode you choose, you either have to destroy all of the enemy's towers or their base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Timer</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is split into two phases: the planning phase and the action phase. During the planning phase, players can place, upgrade and configure towers. During the action phase, the towers perform their actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/extras/6ee3731ed23741953d6e65d20ec6c0ad.poster.avif?t=1757695233\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/extras/6ee3731ed23741953d6e65d20ec6c0ad.webm?t=1757695233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889420/extras/6ee3731ed23741953d6e65d20ec6c0ad.mp4?t=1757695233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Multiplayer</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has been tested with up to eight players at a time. In theory, it is possible to play with up to 100 players in the same lobby. The server capacities are very easily scalable based on demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Campaign</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The campaign consists of multiple short, puzzle-like levels in which you must defeat your enemies. Your enemies won't build or upgrade towers, but you will need to try to become strong enough to reach their base before they reach yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Level Editor</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor allows you to create your own maps. These can be campaign levels or multiplayer maps. You can control the size of the map and which towers and neutral structures, such as gorges and rocks, have been built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also copy your map 